    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McCormack Properties are delighted to present this stunning, five bedroom, dormer bungalow to the market. Ideally located in the centre of Castledermot, this impressive home extends to a spacious c. 230m² and is presented in excellent decorative condition throughout.\n\nThe well-appointed accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with tiled flooring, a fabulous modern kitchen with patio doors providing direct access to the rear garden, and a bright open-plan living/dining room featuring solid wood flooring and an attractive solid fuel stove with a striking floor-to-ceiling natural stone clad surround. The ground floor also offers a utility room, three double bedrooms, including the master with en-suite and wardrobe along with a fully tiled family bathroom. \n\nUpstairs, there are two further generous double bedrooms, both benefiting from en-suite bathrooms, together with a spacious open landing area.\n\nAdditional features include triple-glazed windows, a range cooker in the kitchen, and a solid fuel stove in the living room, all contributing to the comfort and efficiency of this exceptional home.\n\nExternally, the property is equally as impressive. The low-maintenance rear garden is fully finished in concrete and features an attractive pergola seating area, creating the perfect space for outdoor dining and entertaining. A high surrounding boundary wall provides excellent privacy, while concrete pathways extend around the entire property for ease of access and maintenance. There is also a substantial block-built shed extending to approximately 19m², offering excellent storage or workshop potential.\n\nTo the front, the property enjoys a neatly maintained lawn, ample off-street parking, and is situated on a quiet lane, providing a peaceful setting while still being within walking distance of all the amenities Castledermot has to offer.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this desirable family home has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.09 x 4.58\nCeramic tiled flooring, under stairs storage, radiator cover\n\nHallway - 6.53 x 1.17\nCeramic tiled flooring, storage closet, hot press\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 5.38 x 7.46\nSolid wood flooring, solid fuel stove with floor to ceiling surround in natural stone cladding, recess lighting, patio doors\n\nKitchen/Diner - 5.46 x 3.45\nCeramic tiled flooring, fully fitted units at eye and floor level, island with storage and seating, range cooker, patio doors to rear\n\nUtility Room - 1.50 x 3.52\nTiled flooring, all services, sink, fitted storage units\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.89 x 2.99\nLaminate flooring, front aspect, double room\n\nEn-suite 1 - 2.92 x 1.11\nFully tiled on floor and walls, WC, WHB, shower, heated towel rail\n\nWardrobe - 1.76 x 1.34\nCarpet flooring, shelving\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.35 x 3.47\nLaminate flooring, rear aspect, double room\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.03 x 3.50\nLaminate flooring, rear aspect, double room\n\nBathroom - 2.89 x 1.85\nFully tiled on floor and walls, WC, WHB, bath with shower over\n\nLanding - 3.16 x 5.65\nCarpet flooring, 2 large Velux windows\n\nBedroom 4 - 5.03 x 4.04\nLaminate flooring, double room, rear and side aspect\n\nEn-suite 2 - 2.30 x 1.89\nFully tiled on floor and walls, WC, WHB, shower\n\nBedroom 5 - 4.84 x 4.07\nLaminate flooring, double room, rear and side aspect\n\nEn-suite 3 - 1.93 x 1.24\nFully tiled on floor and walls, WC, WHB, shower\n\n"
